---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";

const { title } = Astro.props;
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Service manual for Zain Haider, software developer. Shipped Node.js and Python systems."
    />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen">
    <!--
THESIS: The page is a cabinet service manual. Shipped systems are exploded assemblies a recruiter walks up to — not a headshot-hero with a skill marquee.
OWN-WORLD: Newsprint #E8DCC8, ink #1A1814, stamp #C41E3A, cyan #2A6F97. Big Shoulders Display plates, Source Sans 3 body. Hole-punch binding, snipped plates, overprint rules, revision stamps. No CRT, pixels, or neon.
STORY: A hiring manager inspects the machines, requests the résumé packet, and calls the operator in.
FIRST VIEWPORT: Model-plate name across the top, full size. Left: exploded drawing of the primary portal with numbered balloons. Right: keyed notes, parts, Resume stamp and Call-in stamp as the primary actions.
FORM: Operator Manual, 1 of 7, seed f4b27d09.
FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md
-->
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to contents</a>
    <div class="manual-page">
      <div class="binding" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="punch"></span>
        <span class="punch"></span>
        <span class="punch"></span>
        <span class="punch"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <Header />
        <main id="main">
          <slot />
        </main>
        <Footer />
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
